Text: 3.6 Multi-Document/Domain-Speciﬁc Summarization We here use machine learning based approach to further increase the quality of our summa- rization technique. The elemental concept is that we use training set of u domain speciﬁc documents, with gold standard/human-composed summaries, provided we ﬁne tune our weights Wi∀i ∈(1, g) for different models taking F1- score/F-measure.(Powers, 2011) as factor.

